    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"400289\">Artie Khovanov</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/.60AdjoinRoot.60.20is.20a.20field/near/614083357\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I would recommend proving it for <code>IsAdjoinRoot</code> rather than <code>AdjoinRoot</code>, for greater generality</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>How should I state it in that case?</p>",
