    {
        "content": "<p>maybe I'm misunderstanding something, but doesn't <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"439483\">@Andrew Yang</span> give a much shorter proof in the IsAdjoinRoot case? which the AdjoinRoot case can trivially follow from?</p>",
