    {
        "content": "<p>To be fair I am not sure if we want this in mathlib.<br>\nThe right statement is \"IsField (AdoinRoot f) &lt;-&gt; Prime f\" for one-dimensional domains.<br>\nIrreducible &lt;-&gt; Prime is just something extra when you have a PID and we have this already.</p>",
